     "Shopee and Lazada are the Amazon of Thailand; TikTok Shop TH is third. Need a Thai phone number to register; pay by card, ShopeePay/LazWallet, or COD.",
     "COD (cash on delivery): pick 'Cash on Delivery' at checkout, pay the rider cash (have small notes). Great for no Thai bank account.",
     "Since 1 Jan 2026 Thailand charges import duty + 7% VAT on ALL imported goods from 1 THB (the old 1,500 THB de minimis is gone). Shopee/Lazada/TikTok add it at checkout for cross-border sellers.",
     "Amazon.com ships many items to Thailand via AmazonGlobal: checkout shows an 'Import Fees Deposit' and refunds any overage. Filter for 'Ships to Thailand'. Lithium batteries/liquids often restricted.",
     "US package forwarders (MyUS, Shipito) give you a US address for stores that won't ship abroad; you pay forwarder + international shipping, then Thai duty + 7% VAT on arrival (courier bills you or Thai Post notice).",
     "Sending/receiving locally: Flash Express and KEX drop-offs are everywhere (many in 7-Eleven/local shops); Thailand Post for cheapest domestic/international and EMS. Lalamove for same-day bulky items."
